================================================================================
PART 2: EXTRACTED RESEARCH DATA & AUDIT LEDGERS (data/S1–S4, docs/assets/data/*)
================================================================================

The structured evidence matrices and screening ledgers (`data/S1`–`S4`) constitute
underlying research data accompanying the Data Availability statement of:

  J. Bai, Z. Cai, R. Yang, K. Lekadir, and S. Li, "A review of Kolmogorov–Arnold
  networks for medical image analysis," Computerized Medical Imaging and Graphics,
  vol. 136, 102827, 2026. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compmedimag.2026.102827

Reuse of the curated datasets and taxonomy in scholarly work is permitted with
proper citation to the original article above.

